<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<script>try{var t=localStorage.getItem("treatise-theme");if(t==="light"||t==="dark")document.documentElement.setAttribute("data-theme",t)}catch(e){}if(!matchMedia("(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)").matches){document.documentElement.classList.add("rv");setTimeout(function(){if(!window.treatiseRevealed)document.documentElement.classList.add("rv-done")},2500)}</script>
<title>{{ page.title | strip_html }} · Giorgio Micaletto</title>
<meta name="description" content="{{ page.description | strip_html | escape }}">
<link rel="icon" href="/assets/treatise/favicon.svg?v=3" type="image/svg+xml">
<link rel="canonical" href="https://giorgiomb.github.io{{ page.url }}">
<meta property="og:type" content="website">
<meta property="og:title" content="{{ page.title | strip_html | escape }} · Giorgio Micaletto">
<meta property="og:description" content="{{ page.description | strip_html | escape }}">
<meta property="og:url" content="https://giorgiomb.github.io{{ page.url }}">
<meta name="twitter:card" content="summary">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/treatise/treatise.min.css?v=3">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/treatise/demos.min.css?v=3">
</head>
<body>
<header class="page-head">
  <nav class="running-head" aria-label="Main">
    <a href="/">About</a>
    <a href="/publications/">Publications</a>
    <a href="/projects/" aria-current="page">Projects</a>
    <button type="button" class="theme-toggle" aria-label="Show the steel plate" title="Show the steel plate"><svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true"><defs><clipPath id="tt-half"><path d="M10 2.75A7.25 7.25 0 0 0 10 17.25Z"/></clipPath></defs><g clip-path="url(#tt-half)" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1"><line x1="0" y1="4" x2="4" y2="0"/><line x1="0" y1="7" x2="7" y2="0"/><line x1="0" y1="10" x2="10" y2="0"/><line x1="0" y1="13" x2="13" y2="0"/><line x1="0" y1="16" x2="16" y2="0"/><line x1="0" y1="19" x2="19" y2="0"/><line x1="0" y1="22" x2="22" y2="0"/></g><circle cx="10" cy="10" r="7.25" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.3"/></svg></button>
  </nav>
</header>

<main class="folio" id="main">
{{ content }}
  <footer class="colophon">
    <svg class="mark" viewBox="0 0 40 36" aria-hidden="true"><polygon points="4,32 36,32 20,4" fill="var(--b-yellow)"/><line x1="4" y1="32" x2="36" y2="32" stroke="var(--b-blue)" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round"/><line x1="4" y1="32" x2="20" y2="4" stroke="var(--b-red)" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round"/><line x1="36" y1="32" x2="20" y2="4" stroke="var(--ink)" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>
    <p>Set in Newsreader, by Production Type. The solids are after Albrecht Dürer, Leonardo da Vinci and Paolo Uccello; the coloured diagrams follow Oliver Byrne’s <cite>Euclid</cite> of 1847. In dark mode you see the steel plate instead of the print.</p>
    <p>Some old cheat codes still work here, from the retro games I spent more hours on than I’d like to admit.</p>
  </footer>
</main>
<div class="toast" id="toast" role="status" aria-live="polite"></div>
<script defer src="/assets/treatise/shared.min.js?v=3"></script>
</body>
</html>
